==Format==
* '''Group Stage''': November ''23<sup>rd</sup>'' - ''25<sup>th</sup>'', 2026''
** Teams are divided into 2 Groups based on seeding
** Each group plays a Single '''Round-Robin''' format
*** Each Group has 6 teams
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 4 teams}} from each group advance to ''[[MR Ignite/2026/Grand Finals#Playoffs|Playoffs]]''
* '''Playoffs''': November ''27<sup>th</sup>'' - November ''29<sup>th</sup>, 2026''
** 8 teams play in a Double-Elimination bracket
** All matches ''(excl. Upper Bracket Quarterfinals, Upper Bracket Semifinals and Grand Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo5}}
** Upper Bracket Quarterfinals and Upper Bracket Semifinals are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Grand Final is a {{Abbr/Bo7}}

